I am getting ready to go to the office.
Today is very hot.
There is strong sunlight outside.
I wear my new light blue cotton kurta.
This kurta is good during the heat.
I take my bag.
My umbrella is on the table.
I look at the umbrella.
It will rain today.
The weather app says so.
But now there is bright sunlight.
There are no clouds in the sky.
Will it rain in the evening?
No, it will not rain today.
I leave the umbrella on the table itself.
I do not take the umbrella in the bag.
Instead, I take a white cotton scarf.
I put it in the bag.
This scarf is very good in the sunlight.
I leave for the office.
